  "selected_clauses": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "start": 1.52,
      "end": 6.08,
      "text": "做丝绒这个品类里,我觉得我们做的是非常非常细的。",
      "members": [
        1
      ],
      "group": 0,
      "role": "hook",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 87,
      "start": 200.28,
      "end": 206.26,
      "text": "每年一到冬季你就会看到这个丝绒的品类就像工作服务一样所有人都在穿因为它好洗穿起来还耐脏",
      "members": [
        87,
        88
      ],
      "group": 1,
      "role": "scene",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "start": 8.72,
      "end": 10.7,
      "text": "以至于这么多年喜欢穿丝绒这个品类的女生,",
      "members": [
        3
      ],
      "group": 2,
      "role": "proof",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "start": 10.88,
      "end": 13.5,
      "text": "很多很多姐妹,只要买丝绒都会想到来泽泽家。",
      "members": [
        4
      ],
      "group": 2,
      "role": "proof",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 175,
      "start": 359.9,
      "end": 362.02,
      "text": "真的是很多人都一直在创我们家的私容",
      "members": [
        175
      ],
      "group": 2,
      "role": "proof",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "start": 13.64,
      "end": 15.26,
      "text": "只要你泽泽做,我不会去其他家买。",
      "members": [
        5
      ],
      "group": 2,
      "role": "proof",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 86,
      "start": 198.24,
      "end": 200.28,
      "text": "所有我们的员工都创我们家四龙都抢",
      "members": [
        86
      ],
      "group": 2,
      "role": "proof",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 140,
      "start": 305.94,
      "end": 309.16,
      "text": "这种丝终都是我们开年定制上万米每一年都要卖",
      "members": [
        140,
        141
      ],
      "group": 3,
      "role": "selling_point",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 145,
      "start": 314.18,
      "end": 315.42,
      "text": "我们借机五万米的丝终面料",
      "members": [
        145
      ],
      "group": 3,
      "role": "selling_point",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 148,
      "start": 317.2,
      "end": 318.68,
      "text": "这种能做定制定单的丝终",
      "members": [
        148
      ],
      "group": 3,
      "role": "selling_point",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 151,
      "start": 322.16,
      "end": 323.96,
      "text": "这个跟你们外面买到的丝是不一样的",
      "members": [
        151
      ],
      "group": 3,
      "role": "selling_point",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 149,
      "start": 318.68,
      "end": 320.72,
      "text": "一定是你今年买到的最好的制好的",
      "members": [
        149
      ],
      "group": 3,
      "role": "selling_point",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "start": 45.94,
      "end": 47.34,
      "text": "就是你觉得他那个料子在哪里都买不到",
      "members": [
        21
      ],
      "group": 3,
      "role": "selling_point",
      "usable": true
    },
    {
      "id": 29,
      "start": 61.83,
      "end": 63.57,
      "text": "这真真正正是品牌才做的东西",
      "members": [
        29
